{
  "ranking": [
    {"id": "patch_f2d9d35bb697", "mechanism": "Qualify trigger with m_axis_tready_int_reg to prevent store_output when output pipeline not ready, fixing missing first output byte"},
    {"id": "patch_a92250a89e31", "mechanism": "Replace constant store_output=1 with m_axis_tvalid signal to gate storage on output channel readiness"},
    {"id": "patch_dcfe3aa1fa32", "mechanism": "Use store_axis_int_to_output for busy_reg to align busy with actual output activity"},
    {"id": "patch_489a6092dfdc", "mechanism": "Use loop variable i for frame_count_next reset in STATE_IDLE when trigger fires"},
    {"id": "patch_0c142226f776", "mechanism": "Reset byte_count_output_reg during synchronous reset block"},
    {"id": "patch_c98c57628a2e", "mechanism": "Use m_axis_tvalid for store_output initialization in STATE_IDLE"},
    {"id": "patch_d85c55cc2e00", "mechanism": "Use loop variable i for frame_count_reg reset"},
    {"id": "patch_de6f8c13a145", "mechanism": "Use busy_reg for frame_next assignment"}
  ],
  "explanation": "The earliest failure at cycle 35 shows m_axis_tdata=0 when 1 is expected, indicating the first output byte is missing. The trigger fires but the output pipeline isn't ready (m_axis_tready_int_reg=0), yet store_output=1 captures stale zero counters. patch_f2d9d35bb697 fixes this by requiring m_axis_tready_int_reg before store_output. patch_a92250a89e31 provides a related guard using m_axis_tvalid. patch_dcfe3aa1fa32 ensures busy_reg tracks actual output activity. The remaining patches address secondary counter resets and state assignments observed in the same failure window."
}
